Package: pkgscreen
Title: A Shiny App for Systematic R Package Screening
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person(
    "Krisanat", "Anukarnsakulchularp",
    email = "krisanat.anu@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0008-5638-7124")
    )
Description: A Shiny app for screening and selecting R packages during a
    systematic review. Searched packages are presented one at a time
    with extra information such as package descriptions for an include
    or exclude decision, with the option to provide the reasons for
    exclusions. The decisions can be saved locally as a CSV file or
    synced to a Google Sheet.
